      <p class="lead">{text.summary}</p><ArticleMetadata {lang} publishedOn={lesson.publishedOn} version={'v'+(lesson.contentVersion??lesson.revision)} revisedOn={lesson.revisedOn} reviewedOn={lesson.reviewedOn}/>
      <ArticleReadingGuide id={lesson.id} {lang}/>
      <div class="notice"><strong>{zh ? '讀完後，你可以' : 'After this lesson, you can'}</strong><ul>{#each text.objectives as objective}<li>{objective}</li>{/each}</ul>{#if lesson.prerequisites.length}<p>{zh ? '先備閱讀：' : 'Prerequisites: '}{#each lesson.prerequisites as id,i}{#if i} · {/if}<a href={data.index.find(l=>l.id===id)?.href}>{data.index.find(l=>l.id===id)?.title}</a>{/each}</p>{/if}</div>
      <nav class="toc" aria-label={zh ? '本文目錄' : 'On this page'}><strong>{zh ? '本文導覽' : 'On this page'}</strong><ol>{#each text.sections as section}<li><a href={'#'+section.id}>{section.heading}</a></li>{/each}<li><a href="#example">{zh ? '完整例子' : 'Worked example'}</a></li><li><a href="#practice">{zh ? '安全練習' : 'Safe practice'}</a></li><li><a href="#questions">{zh ? '測驗' : 'Test'}</a></li><li><a href="#sources">{zh ? '參考來源' : 'Sources'}</a></li></ol></nav>
      <article class="prose">{#each text.sections as section}<section><h2 id={section.id}>{section.heading}</h2>{#each section.paragraphs as p}<p><InlineText text={p}/></p>{/each}{#if section.code}<pre><code>{section.code}</code></pre>{/if}{#if section.sourceIds.length}<p class="source-note">{zh ? '延伸閱讀：' : 'Further reading: '}{#each section.sourceIds as id,i}{#if i} · {/if}<a href={data.sources.find(s=>s.id===id)?.url}>{data.sources.find(s=>s.id===id)?.title}</a>{/each}</p>{/if}</section>{/each}
        <section><h2 id="example">{text.example.title}</h2><p>{text.example.scenario}</p>{#if text.example.code}<pre><code>{text.example.code}</code></pre>{/if}<p>{text.example.reasoning}</p><p><strong>{zh ? '判斷：' : 'Conclusion: '}</strong>{text.example.conclusion}</p></section>
        <Lab lab={text.lab} {lang} keyboardScroll={Boolean(readingGuide(lesson.id,lang))} />
      </article>
      <section><h2 id="questions">{zh ? '測驗' : 'Test'} · {zh ? '檢查你的理由' : 'Check your reasoning'}</h2><p class="muted">{zh ? '選一個答案與作答信心，再閱讀所有選項的解析。答案只儲存在此瀏覽器。' : 'Choose an answer and confidence, then read every explanation. Answers stay in this browser.'}</p>{#each lesson.questions as question (question.id)}<QuestionCard {question} {lang} directReading={lesson.course==='ceh'} />{/each}</section>
      {#if related.length}<section><h2>{zh ? '連結下一個概念' : 'Connect the next idea'}</h2><ul>{#each related as l}<li><a href={l.href}>{l.title}</a></li>{/each}</ul></section>{/if}
      {#if lesson.terms.length}<p class="muted">{zh ? '詞彙：' : 'Terms: '}{#each lesson.terms as id,i}{#if i} · {/if}<a href={localized('/glossary/',lang)+'#'+id}>{data.terms.find(t=>t.id===id)?.term[lang] ?? id}</a>{/each}</p>{/if}
      <section class="sources"><h2 id="sources">{zh ? '參考來源與範圍' : 'Sources & scope'}</h2><p>{zh ? '以下來源支持技術原理；例子、題目與安全練習由本系列原創設計。' : 'These sources support the technical principles. Examples, questions and exercises are original to this series.'}</p><ul>{#each data.sources as source}<li><a href={source.url}>{source.title}</a><span class="muted"> · {source.checkedOn}</span></li>{/each}</ul></section>
      <nav class="next-links" aria-label={zh ? '前後教材' : 'Adjacent lessons'}>{#if at>0 && data.index[at-1].course===lesson.course}<a href={data.index[at-1].href}>← {data.index[at-1].title}</a>{/if}{#if at+1<data.index.length && data.index[at+1].course===lesson.course}<a href={data.index[at+1].href}>{data.index[at+1].title} →</a>{/if}</nav>
    {:else if kind === 'quiz'}
      <p class="lead">{zh ? '用原創情境題檢查理解；每個選項都有判斷理由。這些分數不代表正式考試或實作驗收。' : 'Check understanding with original scenarios and a reason for every option. These answers do not establish exam or practical readiness.'}</p><h2>{zh ? '情境判斷題' : 'Scenario questions'}</h2>{#each questions as question (question.id)}<QuestionCard {question} {lang} directReading />{/each}<a href={modulePath(data.module!.id,lang)+'labs/'}>{zh ? '繼續安全練習' : 'Continue to safe practice'} →</a>
    {:else if kind === 'lab'}
      <p class="lead">{zh ? '本章只使用離線資料、自製輸入或紙上情境。依下列步驟完成，再核對自己留下的證據。' : 'This module uses offline data, self-created inputs or tabletop scenarios. Follow the steps and check the evidence you produce.'}</p>{#each data.selected as l}<Lab lab={l.text[lang].lab} {lang} anchor={'practice-'+l.id} />{/each}
    {:else if kind === 'search'}<Search {lang} /><h2>{zh ? '完整教材目錄' : 'Complete lesson catalog'}</h2><ul class="reading-list compact">{#each data.index as l}<li><span class="eyebrow">{l.course} {l.module}</span><a href={l.href}>{l.title}</a></li>{/each}</ul>
    {:else if kind === 'glossary'}<p class="lead">{zh ? '把名詞放回使用情境。每個定義都連回實際教材，方便跨章回查。' : 'Put each term back in context. Every definition links to lessons where you can apply it.'}</p><dl class="glossary">{#each data.terms as term}<div id={term.id}><dt>{term.term[lang]} <span>{term.term[zh ? 'en' : 'zh']}</span></dt><dd><p>{term.definition[lang]}</p><ul>{#each term.lessons as id}<li><a href={data.index.find(l=>l.id===id)?.href}>{data.index.find(l=>l.id===id)?.title}</a></li>{/each}</ul></dd></div>{/each}</dl>
    {:else if kind === 'review'}<Review questions={data.questions} {lang} />
    {:else if kind === 'standards'}
      <section class="prose"><h2>{zh ? '作者、校對與版本' : 'Authorship, review & versions'}</h2><p>{zh ? 'Jason Chia-Sheng Lin 決定課程方向與雙語發布範圍。這批教材由 AI 協作起草、翻譯與技術校對，來源核對日期為 2026-10-23。工程與內容檢查已納入發布流程；獨立讀者的理解與操作驗收仍待實際回饋。' : 'Jason Chia-Sheng Lin sets the curriculum direction and bilingual publication scope. This release was drafted, translated and technically checked with AI assistance; sources were checked on 2026-10-23. Engineering and content checks are part of release review. Independent reader understanding and practical acceptance still require real feedback.'}</p><p>{zh ? 'CEH 章節以 v13 課程結構作參照，考試範圍另查官方 Exam Blueprint v5.0。本系列涵蓋二十章各一個核心概念，M01 兩篇；這個覆蓋率不等同於完整官方課綱。所有測驗題均為原創，不使用外洩考題。' : 'CEH modules follow the v13 course structure, while exam scope is checked against the official Exam Blueprint v5.0. The series covers one core concept in each of twenty modules, with two lessons in M01; this is not exhaustive official syllabus coverage. All test questions are original and use no leaked exam material.'}</p><p><a href="https://www.eccouncil.org/train-certify/certified-ethical-hacker-ceh/">EC-Council CEH</a> · <a href="https://cert.eccouncil.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/CEH-Exam-Blueprint-v5.pdf">Exam Blueprint v5.0</a></p><h2>{zh ? '安全練習' : 'Safe practice'}</h2><p>{zh ? '這批練習限離線資料、自有輸入與紙上情境。未來若加入網路實作，必須另外明列授權目標、範圍、停止條件與清理方式。不得把教材當成測試第三方系統的授權。' : 'These exercises use offline data, self-created inputs and tabletop scenarios. Future network labs must specify authorized targets, scope, stop conditions and cleanup. Course material never grants permission to test third-party systems.'}</p><h2>{zh ? '隱私與練習紀錄' : 'Privacy & practice records'}</h2><p>{zh ? '本站不建立學員帳號、不收集作答資料、不加入分析追蹤。答案、信心與最後作答時間只放在瀏覽器本機儲存，可在錯題複習頁清除。網站代管服務仍會處理一般 HTTP 請求所需的資訊；本機儲存不是跨裝置備份。' : 'The site creates no learner accounts, collects no answers and adds no analytics. Choices, confidence and the latest attempt time stay in browser storage and can be cleared on the review page. Hosting providers still process information needed for ordinary HTTP requests. Browser storage is not a cross-device backup.'}</p><h2>{zh ? '更正與更新' : 'Corrections & updates'}</h2><p>{zh ? '發現錯誤時，請附上頁面網址、題目 ID、語言與具體理由。題意或答案改變會增加題目版本，舊答案不會被當成新版成績。請勿提交個資、密碼或私人系統資料。' : 'Report a correction with the page URL, question ID, language and specific reasoning. Changes to a question or its answer increase its revision, so old answers do not become results for the new version. Do not submit personal data, passwords or private system information.'}</p><a href="https://github.com/JasonLn0711/kairos-learning/issues">{zh ? '回報教材問題' : 'Report a content issue'}</a></section>
    {/if}
    {#if kind==='search' && data.aaseLinks.length}<h2>{zh?'AI 協作軟體工程教材':'AI-Assisted Software Engineering Lessons'}</h2><p><a href={localized('/courses/aase/v1/',lang)}>{zh?'課程地圖':'Course map'}</a> · <a href={localized('/courses/aase/v1/workshop/',lang)}>{zh?'工作坊資源':'Workshop resources'}</a></p><ul>{#each data.aaseLinks as link}<li><a href={link.href}>{link.title}</a></li>{/each}</ul>{/if}
    {#if kind==='search'}<h2>{zh?'觀點目錄':'Perspectives catalog'}</h2><ul>{#each data.perspectiveLinks as p}<li><a href={p.href}>{p.title}</a></li>{/each}</ul>{/if}
    {#if data.relatedPerspectives.length}<section><h2>{zh?'相關觀點':'Related perspectives'}</h2><ul>{#each data.relatedPerspectives as p}<li><a href={p.href}>{p.title}</a></li>{/each}</ul></section>{/if}
  </main>
</div>
<footer><p><a href={MAIN}>CS Kairos</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> {zh ? '研究與學習，持續累積。' : 'Research and learning, built over time.'}</p><nav aria-label={zh ? '頁尾導覽' : 'Footer navigation'}><a href={MAIN + '/teaching/'}>{zh ? '教學與主站' : 'Teaching & main site'}</a><a href={localized('/standards/',lang)}>{zh ? '內容原則' : 'Content principles'}</a><a href="https://github.com/JasonLn0711/kairos-learning">GitHub</a></nav></footer>

<style>
  .course-home{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .course-home .course-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(45px,max-content) minmax(0,1fr) 25px}
  .course-home .home-intro .text-link{white-space:normal}
  @media(max-width:540px){.course-home .course-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) max-content}.course-home .course-number{grid-column:1 / -1}}
  .dns-lesson :global(pre) { font-size:1rem; line-height:1.8; }
  .new-route-lesson { overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .reading-enhanced{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .reading-enhanced :global(.prose p),.reading-enhanced :global(.prose li),.reading-enhanced :global(.prose td),.reading-enhanced :global(.prose th),.reading-enhanced :global(.prose dd){font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .reading-enhanced :global(pre){max-width:100%;overflow:auto;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7}
  .reading-enhanced :global(:focus-visible){outline:3px solid #175f91;outline-offset:3px}

  .ceh-code :global(pre) { background:#f2f6f5; color:#18252c; }
  .ceh-code :global(pre code) { background:transparent; color:inherit; }
</style>
